<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Devex year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Devex year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating			 loss 3.01 vs profit 3.24</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5.14 vs 3.81</p>
<p>    Sales				   12.64 vs 22.21</p>
<p>    Other income			  39.08 vs 3.80</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    4.20 vs 3.00</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  gain 7.53 vs gain 0.43</p>
<p>    Tax					 nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Interest				 1.21 vs 1.46</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   2.28 vs 3.63</p>
<p>    Minorities		    credit 0.62 vs credit 0.14</p>
<p>NOTE: Devex Ltd  is a gold miner.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
